# D529 (mirrorstack-fleet#611): the paths only the owner merges. A PR that touches one needs the owner's code-owner
# review (the org ruleset on the low-risk repos); any other path may be merged by the fleet's merge App after two
# fleet reviews. Kept equal to mirrorstack-fleet fleet/basic/merge.py OWNER_PATH (GitHub matches these with case;
# the fleet's own check is case-blind and also refuses such a PR).
/.github/              @I-am-nothing
migration              @I-am-nothing
migrations             @I-am-nothing
*.sql                  @I-am-nothing
iam/                   @I-am-nothing
security/              @I-am-nothing
CODEOWNERS             @I-am-nothing
*policy*.json          @I-am-nothing
**/internal/auth/      @I-am-nothing
**/internal/*/auth/    @I-am-nothing
